rted, its error printed."] [247 1 "// localState is a _local's per-thread dicts and its constructor's arguments (localobject)."] [256 1 "// localDict makes o's dict the running thread's, made (and __init__ called again, as CPython's"] [257 1 "// _ldict) on the thread's first access."] [702 4 "// PyErr_SetInterruptEx: only a Python handler is tripped; on the main thread it runs at once (CPython's"] [703 4 "// next eval breaker check is at the call's return)"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[102 34] [173 34] [174 29] [197 51] [212 101] [213 37] [214 48] [241 32] [268 21] [278 56] [279 70] [414 40] [433 50] [599 38] [680 34] [704 26] [724 30]]} (go/file "builtins_thread.go" :imports [


